                  Drop any `.html` file, or select your local project directory. The editor detects all components and stylesheets automatically.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Step 2 -->
            <div class="doppelrand-shell spotlight-card">
              <div class="doppelrand-core p-8 space-y-4">
                <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-indigo-950 text-indigo-300 border border-indigo-500/30 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-xs">02</span>
